  {
   "name": "Anthem Saw",
   "author": "Porridge",
   "category": "lead",
   "tags": [
    "supersaw",
    "trance",
    "unison",
    "delay"
   ],
   "description": "A big supersaw lead: nine detuned saws with an octave above, a filter envelope on every note, a slow LFO breathing the detune and the cutoff, and a vibrato that fades in on held notes. Every note gets its own detune and brightness, and a dotted-eighth delay trails it. Mod wheel: more vibrato; aftertouch: brighter and wider. Macros: brightness, detune, delay.",
