  {
   "name": "Downlifter",
   "author": "Porridge",
   "category": "fx",
   "tags": [
    "noise",
    "pitch envelope",
    "flanger",
    "sweep"
   ],
   "description": "A downlifter for the drop: noise and a detuned saw falling three octaves over three seconds as a filter closes over them, through a slow flanger and a hall. Each one falls in its own direction across the stereo field. Harder hits are brighter. Macros: noise, flange.",
